    </a>
  </div>
<section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Anime Blog / Personal Site</p>
      <h1>欢迎来到<span class="gradient-text">我的二次元小站</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">这里记录我喜欢的动画、角色。希望这个小站既有二次元的热闹，也有个人博客的清爽和易读。</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="/about/">了解我</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href="/works/">查看推荐作品</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="feature-image hero-stage">
        <span class="stage-glow"></span>
        <img src="/tupian/opt/抠图.webp" alt="动漫角色主视觉" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
      </div>
      <div class="stat-grid">
        <div class="panel stat"><strong><%= site.posts.length %></strong><span>博客文章</span></div>
        <div class="panel stat"><strong>∞</strong><span>兴趣收藏</span></div>
        <div class="panel stat"><strong>Live2D</strong><span>互动角色</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <% if (page.posts.length) { %>
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">最新文章</h2>
    <div class="post-list">
      <% page.posts.forEach(function(post){ %>
      <article class="mini-card post-card">
        <div class="post-card-head">
          <h3><a href="<%- url_for(post.path) %>"><%= post.title %></a></h3>
          <span class="post-date"><%= date(post.date, 'YYYY-MM-DD') %></span>
        </div>
        <p><% if (post.excerpt) { %><%- strip_html(post.excerpt).substring(0, 120) %><% } else { %><%- strip_html(post.content).substring(0, 120) %><% } %>…</p>
        <div class="post-card-foot">
          <% if (post.categories && post.categories.length) { %>
            <% post.categories.forEach(function(c){ %>
              <a class="post-card-cat" href="<%- url_for(c.path) %>"><%= c.name %></a>
            <% }) %>
          <% } %>
          <a href="<%- url_for(post.path) %>" class="post-readmore">阅读全文 →</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
    <nav class="pagination">
      <% if (page.prev) { %><a class="button secondary" href="<%- url_for(page.prev_link) %>">← 上一页</a><% } %>
      <% if (page.next) { %><a class="button secondary" href="<%- url_for(page.next_link) %>">下一页 →</a><% } %>
    </nav>
  </section>
  <% } %>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">小站内容</h2>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <article class="mini-card">
        <h3>关于我</h3>
        <p>介绍我的兴趣标签、喜欢的作品类型。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="mini-card">
        <h3>推荐作品</h3>
        <p>整理我喜欢的动画作品，用卡片展示封面、标题和简短推荐理由。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="mini-card">
        <h3>互动氛围</h3>
        <p>点击页面会出现彩色粒子，右下角还有会说话的鲸鱼娘。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
